            "id": 126369,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sprawdź, czy zmienna <code>answer</code> jest równa <code>13</code>, i zapisz wynik w zmiennej <code>correctAnswer</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" answer = \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" correctAnswer = answer == \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(correctAnswer)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"correctAnswer\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>=</code>, następnie <code>==</code> i na końcu <code>13</code>.</p></body></html>"
